// DECEMBER 9 / DAY 1. Existing scene1.yarn is unchanged.
// The player controls Anin between the Dorm conversation and the Classroom,
// between the friends and Fal, between Fal and the friends, and at bedtime.
// The keepsake choice happens inside the friends' dialogue; it is not an object interaction.
// VISUAL TODO: Replace the temporary memory-box and photo-stack square sprites
// with final art when it arrives. The ticket and group photo need no visible sprites.
// Bind MemoryBox and PhotoStack in Classroom Dialogue > YarnCommands > Actors.
// Bind the character names used by movement and visibility commands in each room's Actors list.
// The Sleep choice stops at a December 10 placeholder until the next day's Yarn is ready.

title: Dec9_Declarations
tags: setup testing
---
// Never start this node. Yarn uses it for the new flow's persistent state.
<<declare $dec9_dressed = false>>
<<declare $dec9_keepsake = "none">>
<<declare $dec9_classroom_phase = "intro">>
<<declare $dec9_day_finished = false>>
===

title: Dec9_Dorm_Morning
tags: december9 day1 dorm testing
---
// The new Dorm morning YarnCutscene handles Anin waking.
// Kirana should already be standing near the desk when the fade opens.
<<set $story_exit to true>>
<<set $dec9_dressed to false>>
// CharacterOutfit already uses this variable to choose casual clothes in the Dorm.
<<set $anin_dressed to false>>
<<set $dec9_keepsake to "none">>
<<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "intro">>
<<set $dec9_day_finished to false>>
Kirana: You're up already? I usually have to wake you twice.
Anin: You spent ten minutes looking for your hair tie.
Kirana: And you found it before I did. Again.
Anin: Three years of practice.
Kirana: Hey, you've been pretty quiet since yesterday. Everything okay?
-> Be honest
    Anin: I guess I'm scared things will change after graduation.
    Kirana: They will. But you're not getting rid of me that easily.
-> Brush it off
    Anin: Just thinking too much. I'll be fine.
    Kirana: Alright. But you know you can talk to me, right?
Kirana: Come on. Dira wants us to help clear up the festival leftovers.
<<close_dialogue_bubble>>
<<door_exit "Kirana" "Dorm">>
<<quest_start "dec9" "Get ready and go to school">>
// CONTROL ANIN. Desk: Dec9_Dorm_Desk. Door: Dec9_Dorm_Door.
===

title: Dec9_Dorm_Desk
tags: december9 day1 dorm interactable testing
---
<<if $dec9_dressed is false>>
    Anin: I should hurry.
    -> Get dressed
        <<set $dec9_dressed to true>>
        <<set $anin_dressed to true>>
        <<fade_outfit "Anin" "uniform">>
    -> Cancel
        <<stop>>
<<else>>
    Anin: I'm already wearing my uniform.
<<endif>>
===

title: Dec9_Dorm_Door
tags: december9 day1 dorm interactable testing
---
<<if $dec9_classroom_phase == "night">>
    // The night scene ends at the bed; do not return to the Classroom.
    Anin: I don't need to go outside
<<elseif $dec9_dressed is false>>
    Anin: I can't go out like this.
<<else>>
    <<scene_transition "Classroom" "door">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Dec9_Classroom_Arrival
tags: december9 day1 classroom testing
---
<<set $story_exit to true>>
<<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "intro">>
// Show the temporary props until their final sprites arrive.
<<show "MemoryBox">>
<<show "PhotoStack">>
<<quest_update "dec9" "Talk with your friends">>
// CONTROL ANIN. The friends' interaction starts Dec9_Classroom_Friends.
// The Classroom map door runs Dec9_Classroom_Door until the scripted walk home.
===

title: Dec9_Classroom_Door
tags: december9 day1 classroom interactable testing
---
Anin: I should stay here for now.
===

title: Dec9_Classroom_Friends
tags: december9 day1 classroom interactable testing
---
<<if $dec9_classroom_phase == "intro">>
    Dira: One last box. Let's keep something memorable and recycle the rest.
    Lila: Then this ticket stays.
    Dira: Lila, that's literally trash.
    Lila: It's proof of Kirana's legendary ring-toss disaster!
    Kirana: I almost won!
    Anin: You missed every ring.
    Lila: See? Anin laughed so hard she nearly cried.
    Kirana: We could keep our group photo instead.
    Dira: We only have room for one. Anin, you choose.
    -> Keep the ring-toss ticket
        <<set $dec9_keepsake to "ticket">>
        Lila: YES! Our greatest achievement.
        Kirana: My greatest embarrassment, you mean.
        Lila: Same thing!
    -> Keep the group photograph
        <<set $dec9_keepsake to "photo">>
        Kirana: Remember first year? You'd never let us take a photo of you.
        Anin: You kept asking.
        Kirana: And now you're the one making sure we're all in it.

    <<delay 0.5>>
    <<hide "PhotoStack">>
    <<delay 0.5>>
    Dira: That's everything. Hard to believe graduation's so close.
    Dira: At least my university applications are finally done.
    Lila: Of course yours are. I've got a media program interview next week. Apparently talking too much is a useful skill.
    Kirana: My parents are already asking what I need for the move.
    Anin: You're really moving that soon?
    Kirana: Not tomorrow, silly. But yeah, it's actually happening!
    Dira: What about you, Anin? Have you decided where you're applying?
    Anin: I...
    Anin: ...don't even know what I want to study yet.
    Dira: I can help you compare some options.
    Kirana: Dira, she doesn't need to figure everything out today.
    Anin: …
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    // Place Fal just off the camera's left edge in the Classroom scene.
    <<show "FalSceneDec9">>
    <<move_character_to_actor "FalSceneDec9" "Anin" -3.5 6 "walk">>
    Fal: Hi all, having fun?
    <<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "fal">>
    <<quest_update "dec9" "Talk to Fal">>
    // CONTROL ANIN.
<<elseif $dec9_classroom_phase == "myth">>
    // The group finishes sorting the keepsakes.
    Dira: That's everything. One less thing to worry about before graduation.
    Anin: I wish we could have another day like yesterday.
    Lila: You know, a senior once swore she repeated the same day.
    Kirana: What?
    Dira: Not the calendar story again…
    Lila: It's an old school myth. Circle today's date on a calendar, make a wish before midnight, and you'll wake up to the same day again.
    Dira: And somehow nobody can prove it?
    Lila: That's what makes it a mystery!
    Anin: ...Before midnight?
    Dira: Anin, it's just a rumor.
    <<delay 0.6>>
    // Hold on black for the school bell. The room returns after school with
    // Anin alone, already partway toward the classroom door.
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "day_end">>
    <<fade_black_out>>
    <<hide "KiranaSceneDec9">>
    <<hide "DiraSceneDec9">>
    <<hide "LilaSceneDec9">>
    <<set_time_of_day "after_school">>
    <<teleport_character "Anin" -16.3 "left">>
    <<sfx "day_transition">>
    <<delay 1>>
    <<jump Dec9_Classroom_Day_End>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Dec9_Classroom_Fal
tags: december9 day1 classroom interactable testing
---
<<if $dec9_classroom_phase == "fal">>
    Fal: Oh, what's up Anin?
    Fal: Dira's planning your future again?
    Anin: ...Pretty much.
    Fal: Want me to change the subject?
    Anin: You always know when to ask.
    Fal: You did the same for me last week.
    Anin: When your parents brought up medicine again?
    Fal: Yeah. I ended up talking about aerospace for an hour.
    Anin: You sounded happier.
    Fal: And you stayed to listen.
    Anin: I wanted to.
    Fal: ...I'm glad you did.
    Fal: See you tomorrow, Anin.
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<move_character "FalSceneDec9" -17.22 6 "walk">>
    <<hide "FalSceneDec9">>
    <<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "myth">>
    <<quest_update "dec9" "Go back to the group">>
    // CONTROL ANIN. Return to Dec9_Classroom_Friends.
<<endif>>
===

title: Dec9_Classroom_Day_End
tags: december9 day1 classroom testing
---
// Start Anin's walk under black so she is already moving as the room fades in.
// Kirana interrupts her after about 1.1 seconds of walking in total.
<<hide "MemoryBox">>
<<start_character_move "Anin" -21.5 2 "walk" 0>>
<<fade_black_in>>
<<delay 0.45>>
<<stop_character_move "Anin">>
<<teleport_character "KiranaSceneDec9" 8.6 "left">>
<<show "KiranaSceneDec9">>
Kirana: Anin, coming? We can walk back together.
<<close_dialogue_bubble>>
<<face_character "Anin" "right">>
<<move_character_to_actor "KiranaSceneDec9" "Anin" 2.5 6 "walk">>
Anin: Yeah. Just a second.
// Anin's next line is an inner thought. Parentheses mark it until a thought style exists.
Anin: (Tomorrow's our last day here…)
Anin: Okay… let's go.
<<close_dialogue_bubble>>
<<start_character_move "Anin" -24 3 "walk" 0>>
<<start_character_move "KiranaSceneDec9" -24 3 "walk" 0.3>>
// Fade while they walk. Keep the screen black until both reach the door.
<<fade_black_out>>
<<wait_for_character_moves>>
// Load the Dorm from black and switch to the Night look during the load.
<<advance_time_to_scene_at_x_silent "night" "Dorm" 11.03 "left">>
===

title: Dec9_Dorm_Night
tags: december9 day1 dorm night testing
---
// The scene loads empty; Anin and Kirana begin at the Dorm doorway.
// Anin's arrival X is set by the preceding transition; position Kirana at that doorway in Unity.
<<set $story_exit to true>>
<<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "night">>
// Hide both while the room transition opens, then let the player see the empty Dorm.
<<hide "Anin">>
<<hide "Kirana">>
<<delay 0.5>>
<<teleport_character "Kirana" 11.5 "left">>
<<open_door "Dorm">>
<<show "Anin">>
<<start_character_move "Anin" -3.4 3 "walk" 0>>
<<delay 1>>
<<show "Kirana">>
<<start_character_move "Kirana" 6.3 3 "walk" 0>>
<<wait_for_character_moves>>
<<face_character "Anin" "right">>
<<close_door "Dorm">>
Kirana: Last school day tomorrow. I'll wake you early.
Anin: As usual.
<<quest_update "dec9" "Go to bed">>
// CONTROL ANIN. The Bed interaction starts Dec9_Dorm_Bed.
===

title: Dec9_Dorm_Kirana_Night
tags: december9 day1 dorm night interactable testing
---
<<if $dec9_classroom_phase == "night">>
    Kirana: Good Night, Anin
<<endif>>
===

title: Dec9_Dorm_Bed
tags: december9 day1 dorm night interactable testing
---
<<if $dec9_day_finished is false>>
    -> Sleep
        Anin: Let's enjoy tomorrow to the fullest
        <<set $dec9_day_finished to true>>
        <<quest_clear>>
        // PLACEHOLDER: Transition to December 10 morning when its new Yarn exists.
    -> Not now
        // Return control to Anin; the bed can be used again later.
<<endif>>
===
